# Cross-origin isolation unlocks SharedArrayBuffer → multi-threaded wasm in
# the OCR workers. Honored by Cloudflare Pages and Netlify; GitHub Pages
# ignores this file (OCR there just stays single-threaded).
/*
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin
  Cross-Origin-Embedder-Policy: require-corp
  Cross-Origin-Resource-Policy: same-origin
